{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":21,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["关于巴比伦的预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是关于海边沙漠",{"noteId":10},"的预言：",{"text":"敌人从可怕的沙漠之地上来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像狂风扫过南部的旷野。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看见一个可怖的异象：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“诡诈的在行诡诈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁灭的在行毁灭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以拦人啊，攻打吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"玛代人啊，围城吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华必终止巴比伦带来的痛苦。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这使我充满痛苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我陷入剧痛中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同分娩的妇人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因听见的话而惊慌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因看见的景象而害怕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心慌意乱，惊惧不堪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我期盼的黄昏却令我恐惧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们摆设宴席，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"铺开地毯又吃又喝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首领啊，起来擦亮盾牌备战吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主对我说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你去派人守望，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让他报告所看见的情况。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他看到战车、一对对的骑兵、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"驴队和骆驼队的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要提高警惕，密切察看。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"守望的人大喊：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“主啊，我终日站在瞭望塔上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"整夜守在自己的岗位上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，战车和一对对的骑兵来了。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他又接着说：“巴比伦倾倒了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倾倒了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它所有的神像都被打碎在地上。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"于是，我说：“我的百姓啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们像场上被碾、被筛的谷物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在我把从以色列的上帝——万军之耶和华那里听见的都告诉你们了。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["关于以东的预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"以下是关于度玛的预言。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有人从西珥大声问道：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“守望者啊，黑夜还有多长？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"守望者啊，黑夜还有多长？”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"守望者回答：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“黎明将到，但黑夜会再来。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们想问就问吧，可以再回来。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["关于阿拉伯的预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"以下是关于阿拉伯的预言：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"底但的商队必宿在阿拉伯的树林中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"提玛的居民啊，要送水给这些口渴的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿食物给这些逃难的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们逃离了刀光箭影和激烈的战争。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["主对我说：“按雇工规定的做工年限，一年之内，基达所有的荣耀必消失，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["勇敢的弓箭手必所剩无几。这是以色列的上帝耶和华说的。”"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"“海边沙漠”指巴比伦。","reference":{"chapter":21,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/21.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/22.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/20.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}